# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TWO-LAYER DOCUMENTATION POLICY (governance v3, 2026-09-05)
#
# Layer 1 - GLOBAL / SHAREABLE: product and project rules both leads work
#           from. TRACKED in git and shareable with the Product & Frontend
#           Lead:
#             README.md, PROJECT-LOGIC.md, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md,
#             docs/global/**, .github/**
#
# Layer 2 - PRIVATE: domain-owner guidelines. NOT stored in the repository:
#             docs/founder/**  - backend / data / AI / ops (Founder)
#             docs/product/**  - frontend / design (Product & Frontend Lead)
#
# Replicate private-layer files outside the repository; git-ignored is not
# backed up.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.md
!/README.md
!/PROJECT-LOGIC.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/docs/global/
!/docs/global/**
!/.github/
!/.github/**

# The agent operating rules are workflow too, and settings.json is not markdown
# so the rule above does not reach it. To publish them, delete this line.
.claude/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Next.js
# next-env.d.ts is generated by `next dev` / `next build` / `next typegen`;
# Next.js documents it as git-ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.next/
/out/
/build/
.turbo/
next-env.d.ts

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TypeScript
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Testing
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/coverage/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deployment
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vercel/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Migrations are reviewable artifacts and are COMMITTED.
# Nothing under drizzle/ is ignored — this note exists so nobody adds it later.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
